{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hana.crepe",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "可丽饼摊前，她要你也吃一口",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hana.crepe",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hana.crepe",
    "idolId": "hana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……──　好吃──！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "店员说「准备已经做好了」就给我们做了，真是太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "嗯！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "这个可丽饼，制作人也吃一点？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不不……！我不用了，羽那全部吃掉吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "真是的──，制作人从刚才开始就一直在拒绝──！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "明明说了「什么都帮你实现」。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……制作人这个大骗子。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天本来想让羽那开心的。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "结果我好像一直在妨碍羽那享受。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……你觉得我看上去，像是觉得制作人很碍事？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不、不是那个意思──",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "我是想和制作人一起做更多开心的事啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "所以说，与其说碍事，",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "不如说制作人不在的话我就不愿意。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "更抱歉了。我完全没懂羽那的心情……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……啊哈。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "你明白了就好哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……快到时间了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "一直待在这里是不行的吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯，和工作人员约好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "这样啊──，好可惜。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "──呐。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "果然，最后能给我一个回忆吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "回忆……？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "让我以后想起「可丽饼好好吃啊」的时候，",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "能想起「是和制作人一起吃的」的那种回忆──！",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……也就是说，到底是什么意思……？",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "啊哈，好迟钝──！",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "就是说，这个可丽饼，还是想让制作人也吃一口啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "hana",
        "text": "……对吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……好。那我就不客气了。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
